  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1861\">\n<li data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1641\">\n<p data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1641\"><strong data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1614\">Hypercellular marrow with increased blasts</strong> &rarr; Suggests acute leukemia.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1642\" data-end=\"1714\">\n<p data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1714\"><strong data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1686\">Hypocellular marrow with reduced lines</strong> &rarr; Possible aplastic anemia.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1795\">\n<p data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1795\"><strong data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1760\">Erythroid hyperplasia with reduced iron</strong> &rarr; Suggests iron deficiency anemia.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1861\">\n<p data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1861\"><strong data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1824\">Increased plasma cells</strong> &rarr; Consider multiple myeloma if &gt;10%.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
